WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:05.520
GREAT VISUAL EFFECTS CAN COMPLETELY
CHANGE A FILM'S EXPERIENCE.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.800
WHEN I WAS 7, LIVING IN TAYLOR,
MICHIGAN, MY MOTHER TOOK ME

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.758
TO WATCH "TERMINATOR 2"
AT THE THEATERS.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.280
I'M PRETTY SURE SHE DIDN'T
KNOW WHAT THE MOVIE WAS ABOUT

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.520
AND TO HER, AND MY, SURPRISE
WE GOT TO SEE SOME STUFF

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.797
WE GOT TO SEE T-1000 GET HIS
HEAD BLOWN OFF 

00:00:20.797 --> 00:00:22.192
AND THEN FORMED 
BACK TOGETHER.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.558
AND ARNOLD CUT HIS ARM SKIN
TO REVEAL A ROBOT HAND

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.560
AND I JUST REMEMBER GLANCING
AT MY MOM A FEW TIMES TRYING

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.600
TO SEE IF THIS WAS OKAY FOR ME TO
WATCH, AND MY MOM PLAYING IT

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.179
COOL AS IF SHE MEANT TO
BRING ME TO THIS MOVIE

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.800
BUT MAYBE THAT'S JUST MY MEMORY.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.880
MAYBE SHE REVELED IN THE FACT
THAT SHE GOT TO SEE A BADASS MOM

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:44.800
DUKE IT OUT WITH FUTURE ROBOTS
WITH HER SON IN 1991.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.880
THE WAY THAT THE TECHNOLOGY AND
THE EXPERTISE IN VISUAL EFFECTS

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.240
HAS ADVANCED IN THE 30 YEARS
SINCE "T2" IS STAGGERING.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.680
THEY HAVE BECOME THE KEY ELEMENT
IN MANY OF THE BIGGEST FILMS IN

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.880
CINEMA HISTORY.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:00.320
AND WITH EACH YEAR, THOSE WHO
ARE THE BEST IN THE WORLD TOP

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:03.520
EVEN THEMSELVES, AND TAKE THE
ART TO ANOTHER LEVEL.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.902
LIKE THIS YEAR'S NOMINEES.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.480
"LOVE AND MONSTERS."

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.640
MATT SLOAN, GENEVIEVE CAMILLERI,
MATT EVERITT, AND BRIAN COX.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:18.560
"THE MIDNIGHT SKY,"
MATTHEW KASMIR,

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.760
CHRISTOPHER LAWRENCE,
MAX SOLOMON, AND DAVID WATKINS.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.240
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.077
"MULAN,"

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:29.840
SEAN FADEN, ANDERS LANGLANDS,
SETH MAURY, AND STEVE INGRAM.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.240
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.160
