00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.400
WELL, ALL MY COLLEAGUES
ARE OVERSEAS.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.960
UNFORTUNATELY FOR THEM,
THEY HAVE TO LET ME SPEAK,

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.320
SO THIS IS WHAT YOU GET.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:22.400
IT'S AMAZING, AMAZING.
OUR VISUAL EFFECTS TEAM

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.520
ON “TENET,” WE DID SO MANY
THINGS AND THERE'S SO MANY

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:29.440
